<title>USA: Fluke acquires DeskNet Systems Inc.</title>
<headline>Fluke acquires DeskNet Systems Inc.</headline>
<dateline>EVERETT, Wash. 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fluke Corp on Thursday said it acquired DeskNet Systems Inc, a privately-held maker of computer network products for 305,000 common shares.</p>
<p>Fluke stock closed at 48-1/2, up 1-3/8 on Thursday.</p>
<p>Based in Armonk, New York, DeskNet sells handheld, wide area Asynchronous Transfer Mode testing products, which will expand Fluke's line of handheld test tools for the networking market.</p>
